&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Who we are&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Gatik, the leader in autonomous middle-mile logistics, is revolutionizing the B2B supply chain with its autonomous transportation-as-a-service (ATaaS) solution and prioritizing safe, consistent deliveries while streamlining freight movement by reducing congestion. The company focuses on short-haul, B2B logistics for Fortune 500 retailers and in 2021 launched the world’s first fully driverless commercial transportation service with Walmart. Gatik&#39;s Class 3-7 autonomous trucks are commercially deployed across major markets, including Texas, Arkansas, and Ontario, Canada, driving innovation in freight transportation.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;The company&#39;s proprietary Level 4 autonomous technology, Gatik Carrier™, is custom-built to transport freight safely and efficiently between pick-up and drop-off locations on the middle mile. With robust capabilities in both highway and urban environments, Gatik Carrier™ serves as an all-encompassing solution that integrates advanced software and hardware powering the fleet, facilitating effortless integration into customers&#39; logistics operations.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;About the role&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;The Technical Recruiter will partner closely with engineering and leadership teams across Gatik to attract and hire top-tier technical talent across both hardware and software functions. This role will focus on building strong candidate pipelines, driving full-cycle recruiting efforts, and helping scale high-performing engineering teams in a fast-paced autonomous trucking environment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;You will play a key role in shaping the candidate experience, influencing hiring strategies, and supporting Gatik’s continued growth as a leader in autonomous transportation technology. This is a high-impact opportunity within our growing Talent Acquisition team for someone who thrives in fast-moving, technical, startup environments.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;This role will be onsite 5 days a week at our Santa Clara, CA headquarters.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Partner closely with engineering leaders and hiring managers to define and execute hiring strategies across hardware and software teams&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Manage full-cycle recruiting for technical roles including sourcing, screening, interview coordination, offer negotiation, and closing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Recruit for a wide range of technical positions including Software Engineering, AI/ML, Robotics, Infrastructure, Embedded Systems, Electrical Engineering, Mechanical Engineering, Systems Engineering, Validation/Test Engineering, and related functions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Build and maintain strong pipelines of highly qualified technical talent through creative sourcing strategies and market outreach&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Help shape hiring workflows including interview processes, scorecards, recruiting plans, and candidate evaluation criteria&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Act as an ambassador for Gatik’s mission, culture, and employee value proposition&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Continuously improve recruiting processes to enhance efficiency, candidate experience, and quality of hire&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Provide market insights, compensation trends, and hiring recommendations to leadership teams&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Stay current on industry trends across autonomous vehicles, robotics, AI, infrastructure, and engineering talent markets&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Engage passive candidates and build long-term relationships with top technical talent&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;What we&#39;re looking for&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;BA/BS degree or equivalent practical experience&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;3+ years of full-cycle technical recruiting experience, preferably within startups or high-growth technology companies&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Experience recruiting across both software and hardware engineering functions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Strong understanding of technical roles and ability to effectively assess candidate backgrounds and skillsets&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Experience partnering with engineering leadership and influencing hiring decisions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Proven ability to source and close highly competitive technical talent&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Familiarity with Greenhouse ATS (or similar recruiting tools) is preferred&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Strong organizational skills with the ability to manage multiple searches simultaneously&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Ability to operate effectively in a fast-paced, ambiguous, and evolving environment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;High sense of ownership, urgency, integrity, and attention to detail&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Excellent communication, stakeholder management, and relationship-building skills&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Startup experience strongly preferred&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Salary Range - $50/hr - $70/hr&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;More about Gatik&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Founded in 2017 by experts in autonomous vehicle technology, Gatik has rapidly expanded its presence to Mountain View, Dallas-Fort Worth, Arkansas, and Toronto. As the &lt;em&gt;first and only&lt;/em&gt; company to achieve fully driverless middle-mile commercial deliveries, Gatik holds a unique and defensible position in the AV industry, with a clear trajectory toward sustainable growth and profitability.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;We have delivered complete, proprietary AV technology - an integration of software and hardware - to enable earlier successes for our clients in constrained Level 4 autonomy.&amp;nbsp; By choosing the middle mile – with defined point-to-point delivery, we have simplified some of the more complex AV challenges, enabling us to achieve full autonomy ahead of competitors. Given extensive knowledge of Gatik’s well-defined, fixed route ODDs and hybrid architecture, we are able to hyper-optimize our models with exponentially less data, establish gate-keeping mechanisms to maintain explainability, and ensure continued safety of the system for unmanned operations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Visit us at &lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://gatik.ai/&quot;&gt;Gatik&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; for more company information and &lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://gatik.ai/careers/&quot;&gt;Careers at Gatik&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; for more open roles.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
